### ==========================================
### 菜单/权限管理 — Menu & Permission Management
### 路径前缀：/menu
### 菜单类型：MENU（路由菜单）/ BUTTON（按钮权限）
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 获取当前用户路由菜单（树形）-------------------
### @name Get Route Menus
# 根据当前登录用户的角色，返回有权限的路由菜单树（排除 BUTTON 类型）
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取系统菜单树（全部）-------------------
### @name Get System Menu Tree
# 返回系统所有菜单的完整树形结构（用于菜单管理界面）
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/list HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取根节点菜单 -------------------
### @name Get Menu Roots
# 返回所有父级为 null 的根菜单节点
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/roots HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取子菜单 -------------------
### @name Get Menu Children
# 根据 parentId 查询直接子菜单
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/children?parentId=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取按钮权限 -------------------
### @name Get Buttons by Parent
# 查询指定父菜单下的按钮级权限列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/buttons?parentId=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取角色权限树 -------------------
### @name Get Permissions Tree
# 获取所有菜单和按钮的完整树（用于角色权限分配界面）
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/permissions HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取全部菜单树 -------------------
### @name Get All Menu Tree
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/tree HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 检查菜单名称是否存在 -------------------
### @name Check Menu Name Exists
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/name-exists?name=系统管理&id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 检查菜单路径是否存在 -------------------
### @name Check Menu Path Exists
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/path-exists?path=/system&id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 创建菜单 -------------------
### @name Create Menu
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "用户管理",
  "code": "system:user",
  "type": "MENU",
  "parentId": null,
  "path": "/system/user",
  "icon": "ant-design:user-outlined",
  "component": "/system/user/index.vue",
  "show": true,
  "order": 1
}

### ------------------- 更新菜单 -------------------
### @name Update Menu
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu/update?id=1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "用户管理（已修改）",
  "show": true,
  "order": 2
}

### ------------------- 创建按钮权限 -------------------
### @name Create Button Permission
# 在指定菜单下创建按钮级权限（type=BUTTON），用于前端按钮级别权限控制
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新增用户",
  "code": "system:user:add",
  "type": "BUTTON",
  "parentId": 1,
  "show": false,
  "order": 1
}

### ------------------- 删除菜单 -------------------
### @name Delete Menu
# 删除菜单的同时会清空关联的角色-菜单权限数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu/delete?id=2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
